msgstr "Stücken un Alben na Tofall spelen"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (General Options)
#. +> trunk
#: amarok.kcfg:64
msgid "If set, Amarok plays the tracks or albums in the playlist in a random order."
msgstr "Wenn anmaakt, speelt Amarok de Stücken un Alben op de Afspeellist in en tofällig Reeg."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (General Options)
#. +> trunk
#: amarok.kcfg:73
msgid "The status of dynamic mode."
msgstr "Den dünaamschen Bedrief sien Status"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (General Options)
#. +> trunk
#: amarok.kcfg:74
msgid "If set, dynamic mode will be on, and tracks will be added according to the dynamic playlist specified."
msgstr "Wenn anmaakt, is de dünaamsche Bedrief an, un Stücken warrt ut de angeven dünaamsche Afspeellist toföögt."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry, group (General Options)
#. +> trunk
#: amarok.kcfg:78
msgid "The most recently used Dynamic Mode"
msgstr "De tolest bruukt dünaamsch Bedrief"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry, group (General Options)
#. +> trunk
#: amarok.kcfg:79
msgid "The title of the Dynamic Mode that was most recently loaded in the playlist"
msgstr "De Titel vun den dünaamschen Bedrief, de tolest in de Afspeellist weer"

